@Ecommerce_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### ====================================================================
### 🔐 SECTION 1: AUTHENTICATION & IDENTITY
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Register Admin User
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Admin Ikhtiar",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}


### 1.2 Register Customer User
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Customer Tanvir",
    "email": "tanvir@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}


### 1.3 Login as Admin (Captures Admin Access & Refresh Tokens!)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Automated Admin Tokens
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminRefreshToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}


### 1.4 Login as Customer (Captures Customer Access & Refresh Tokens!)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "tanvir@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Automated Customer Tokens
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@customerRefreshToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}


### 1.5 Rotate Refresh Token (Issues new Access Token & new Refresh Token!)
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{customerRefreshToken}}"
}


### 1.6 Logout / Revoke Token (Returns 204 No Content)
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": "{{customerRefreshToken}}"
}



### ====================================================================
### 🏆 SECTION 2: CLUBS MANAGEMENT
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Create Club (Admin Only -> Expects 201 Created)
# @name createClub
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Real Madrid Away",
    "country": "Spain",
    "league": "La Liga",
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/realmadrid-logo.png"
}

### Automated Club ID
@clubId = {{createClub.response.body.id}}


### 2.2 Get All Clubs (Public -> Paginated)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json


### 2.3 Get Club By ID (Public)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/{{clubId}}
Accept: application/json


### 2.4 Update / Patch Club (Admin Only)
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/{{clubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "league": "La Liga EA Sports",
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/realmadrid-new-logo.png"
}


### 2.5 Delete Club (Admin Only -> Returns 204 No Content)
# (Note: Will be blocked if jerseys are linked to this club due to Restrict rule!)
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/{{clubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}



### ====================================================================
### 👕 SECTION 3: JERSEYS CATALOG & SIZING INVENTORY
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 Create Jersey with Sizing Breakdown (Admin Only -> Expects 201 Created)
# Size Enum: 1=S, 2=M, 3=L, 4=XL, 5=XXL
# @name createJersey
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Real Madrid 24/25 Home Kit",
    "description": "Authentic player edition jersey with gold accents",
    "imageUrls": [
        "https://example.com/realmadrid-home-front.jpg",
        "https://example.com/realmadrid-home-back.jpg"
    ],
    "price": 1500.00,
    "clubId": "{{clubId}}",
    "sizes": [
        { "size": 1, "stockQuantity": 5 },
        { "size": 2, "stockQuantity": 15 },
        { "size": 3, "stockQuantity": 8 },
        { "size": 4, "stockQuantity": 2 }
    ]
}

### Automated Jersey ID
@jerseyId = {{createJersey.response.body.id}}


### 3.2 Get All Jerseys (Basic Pagination)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json


### 3.3 Search Jerseys by Keyword (PostgreSQL ILIKE on Name & Description)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?searchTerm=Madrid
Accept: application/json


### 3.4 Multi-Criteria Filter: Club + Price Range + In-Stock + Sorting
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?clubId={{clubId}}&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=2000&inStockOnly=true&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json


### 3.5 Get Jersey By ID (Shows Nested Club & Granular Sizing Breakdown)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{jerseyId}}
Accept: application/json


### 3.6 Update / Patch Jersey (Admin Only)
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{jerseyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 1650.00,
    "sizes": [
        { "size": 2, "stockQuantity": 20 }
    ]
}


### 3.7 Delete Jersey (Admin Only -> Returns 204 No Content)
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{jerseyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}



### ====================================================================
### 🛍️ SECTION 4: ORDERS & CHECKOUT
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Customer Checkout (Deducts stock specifically for Size M!)
# Size Enum: 1=S, 2=M, 3=L, 4=XL, 5=XXL
# @name createOrder
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "shippingAddress": "House 12, Road 27, Dhanmondi, Dhaka",
    "phoneNumber": "01712345678",
    "items": [
        {
            "jerseyId": "{{jerseyId}}",
            "size": 2,
            "quantity": 2
        }
    ]
}

### Automated Order ID
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}


### 4.2 View My Orders (Customer views their own order history)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders/my-orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 4.3 Get Order By ID (Isolated: Customer can only view their own order)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 4.4 Admin View All Orders Across the Store (Admin Only)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### 4.5 Admin Update Order Status to "Shipped" (Admin Only)
# OrderStatus Enum: 1=Pending, 2=Paid, 3=Shipped, 4=Delivered, 5=Cancelled
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": 3
}


### 4.6 Cancel Order (Restores reserved stock back to Size M in PostgreSQL!)
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}



### ====================================================================
### 🛡️ SECTION 5: ERROR HANDLING & VALIDATION TESTING
### ====================================================================

### 5.1 Test FluentValidation: Invalid Register Body (Expects 400 Validation Problem)
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "",
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "password": "123"
}


### 5.2 Test Query Validator: Impossible Price Range & Invalid Page (Expects 400 Validation Problem)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys?page=0&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=1000&sortBy=invalidColumn
Accept: application/json


### 5.3 Test Global Exception Handler: Unhandled Server Crash (Expects 500 RFC 9457 ProblemDetails)
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/crash-test